{"sessions":[{"session":0,"messages":["Hi, I'm Maya Garcia and I'd like to set up some standing instructions for our chats.","Please always respond in French.","I work at Notion as a designer and have been there since June 2024.","I'm not originally from Lisbon but I've been living here for a while now.","I have a sister named Priya Sharma, though we don't see each other as often as I'd like.","My birthday is June 22, in case you ever need to send me something nice."],"conveyed":["s0f0","s0f1","s0f2","s0f3","s0f4","s0f5","s0f6"]},{"session":1,"messages":["Hey! It's been a while since I had an oat milk latte - I don't really drink those anymore.","I'm not into techno like I used to be, now it's mostly lo-fi beats for me.","Actually, I'm a bit of a programming languages enthusiast - I know Kotlin, Rust, and Go.","When I'm not coding or designing, I'm not usually sitting around doing nothing.","I enjoy kayaking quite a bit, though I haven't been on the water in a while.","I also play chess sometimes, though I'm not very good at it.","What's new with you?"],"conveyed":["s1f0","s1f1","s1f2","s1f3","s1f4","s1f5","s1f6"]},{"session":2,"messages":["Hey there, I need to update you on my work situation.","I'm not with Notion anymore - I left back in March 2025.","I joined Ramp in March 2025 as a designer, and it's been going well so far.","It's a different environment than Notion, but I'm enjoying the change.","The team is great and the projects are interesting.","Have you heard of Ramp before? They're doing some cool stuff in the fintech space."],"conveyed":["s2f0","s2f1"]},{"session":3,"messages":["Hi! I have some news about where I'm living now.","I'm not in Lisbon anymore - I moved to Toronto in September 2025.","It's been a while since I lived in a place that gets cold winters, but I'm adjusting.","Toronto has a great design community, so I'm excited to be part of that.","I don't miss the Lisbon weather as much as I thought I would.","How are things where you are?"],"conveyed":["s3f0"]},{"session":4,"messages":["Hey! I wanted to tell you about my team at Ramp.","My manager is Priya - she's actually my sister!","Priya manages the Payments team, which I'm now a part of.","The Payments team uses Kotlin for most of our backend work.","I'm not on the design side as much as I used to be, but I'm enjoying the technical challenges.","It's been interesting to work so closely with family, though we try not to talk about work too much outside the office."],"conveyed":["s4f0","s4f1","s4f2","s4f3"]},{"session":5,"messages":["Hey! I wanted to give you an update on my recent projects.","I'm not working on Project Cedar anymore - we finished that in January 2026.","I'm currently working on Project Falcon, which is quite different from what I've done before.","I'm not sure if I told you, but I also worked on Project Fable, which we finished in April 2026.","It's been a busy few months with all these projects wrapping up and starting up.","Do you keep up with different projects in your work?"],"conveyed":["s5f0","s5f1","s5f2"]},{"session":6,"messages":["Hey! I have some personal updates to share.","On September 25, 2025, I adopted a cat - I'm not really a dog person, so this was a big change for me.","It's been a while since I had a pet, and I'm really enjoying having a cat around.","On April 27, 2026, I rebuilt the CI pipeline for our team - it's not the most exciting thing I've worked on, but it was necessary.","The new pipeline has made deployments much smoother, so that's been nice.","How have you been? Anything new in your world?"],"conveyed":["s6f0","s6f1"]},{"session":7,"messages":["Hi! I have some updates about my professional activities.","On May 1, 2025, I spoke at a conference - it was my first time doing that, and I was pretty nervous.","On September 11, 2026, I deployed the payment service we've been working on for months.","It's been a while since I've done a deployment of that scale, so I'm relieved it went well.","I'm not into techno anymore - I've switched to lo-fi beats for my music preferences.","I find it helps me focus better when I'm working or just relaxing.","Hope you're doing well!"],"conveyed":["s7f0","s7f1","s7f2"]}]}
